    "Local completion alerts for servers without push notifications." : {"localizations": {"de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Lokale Abschlussmeldungen für Server ohne Push-Benachrichtigungen."}}, "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Avisos locales de finalización para servidores sin notificaciones push."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Alertes locales de fin de réponse pour les serveurs sans notifications push."}}, "it": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Avvisi locali di completamento per i server senza notifiche push."}}, "pl": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Lokalne alerty o zakończeniu dla serwerów bez powiadomień push."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Alertas locais de conclusão para servidores sem notificações push."}}, "nl": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Lokale voltooiingsmeldingen voor servers zonder pushmeldingen."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Push bildirimi olmayan sunucular için yerel tamamlanma uyarıları."}}, "ru": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "Локальные оповещения о завершении для серверов без push-уведомлений."}}, "ja": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "プッシュ通知のないサーバー向けのローカル完了通知。"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "为未启用推送通知的服务器提供本地完成提醒。"}}, "ko": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "푸시 알림이 없는 서버의 로컬 완료 알림입니다."}}, "ar": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "تنبيهات إكمال محلية للخوادم التي لا تستخدم إشعارات الدفع."}}, "he": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "התראות סיום מקומיות עבור שרתים ללא התראות Push."}}, "ur": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "پش اطلاعات کے بغیر سرورز کے لیے تکمیل کے مقامی الرٹس۔"}}, "zh-Hant": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "value": "為未啟用推播通知的伺服器提供本機完成提示。"}}, "zh-HK": {"stringUnit": {"state": "needs_review", "v