    "Turn off notifications for this server?" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mitteilungen für diesen Server deaktivieren?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Desactivar las notificaciones de este servidor?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Désactiver les notifications pour ce serveur ?"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Disattivare le notifiche per questo server?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wyłączyć powiadomienia dla tego serwera?"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Desativar as notificações deste servidor?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Meldingen voor deze server uitschakelen?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu sunucu için bildirimler kapatılsın mı?"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выключить уведомления для этого сервера?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このサーバの通知をオフにしますか？"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"关闭此服务器的通知？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 서버의 알림을 끌까요?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"إيقاف إشعارات هذا الخادم؟"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"לכבות התראות עבור שרת זה?"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اس سرور کے لیے اطلاعات آف کریں؟"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"關閉此伺服器的通知？"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"關閉此伺服器的通知？"}}}},
    "This Hermes host returned pairing keys Hermex cannot use. Update the hermex-push plugin." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieser Hermes-Host hat Kopplungsschlüssel zurückgegeben, die Hermex nicht verwenden kann. Aktualisiere das hermex-push-Plug-in."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este host de Hermes devolvió claves de emparejamiento que Hermex no puede usar. Actualiza el complemento hermex-push."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cet hôte Hermes a renvoyé des clés de jumelage inutilisables par Hermex. Mettez à jour le plug-in hermex-push."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo host Hermes ha restituito chiavi di associazione che Hermex non può usare. Aggiorna il plugin hermex-push."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten host Hermes zwrócił klucze parowania, których Hermex nie może użyć. Zaktualizuj wtyczkę hermex-push."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este host do Hermes retornou chaves de pareamento que o Hermex não pode usar. Atualize o plugin hermex-push."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze Hermes-host gaf koppelingssleutels terug die Hermex niet kan gebruiken. Werk de hermex-push-plug-in bij."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu Hermes sunucusu, Hermex’in kullanamayacağı eşleştirme anahtarları döndürdü. hermex-push eklentisini güncelleyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот хост Hermes вернул ключи связи, которые Hermex не может использовать. Обновите плагин hermex-push."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この Hermes ホストは Hermex が使用できないペアリングキーを返しました。hermex-push プラグインを更新してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主机返回了 Hermex 无法使用的配对密钥。请更新 hermex-push 插件。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 Hermes 호스트가 Hermex에서 사용할 수 없는 페어링 키를 반환했습니다. hermex-push 플러그인을 업데이트하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"أعاد مضيف Hermes هذا مفاتيح إقران لا يمكن لـ Hermex استخدامها. حدّث إضافة hermex-push."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"מארח Hermes זה החזיר מפתחות התאמה ש‑Hermex אינו יכול להשתמש בהם. יש לעדכן את התוסף hermex-push."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اس Hermes ہوسٹ نے ایسی پیئرنگ کیز دیں جو Hermex استعمال نہیں کر سکتا۔ hermex-push پلگ ان اپ ڈیٹ کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主機傳回 Hermex 無法使用的配對密鑰。請更新 hermex-push 外掛程式。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主機傳回 Hermex 無法使用的配對密鑰。請更新 hermex-push 外掛程式。"}}}},
    "The plugin did not answer after the restart. Check that Hermes came back up, then try again." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Das Plug-in hat nach dem Neustart nicht geantwortet. Prüfe, ob Hermes wieder läuft, und versuche es erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El complemento no respondió tras el reinicio. Comprueba que Hermes volvió a iniciarse e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le plug-in n’a pas répondu après le redémarrage. Vérifiez que Hermes a bien redémarré, puis réessayez."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il plugin non ha risposto dopo il riavvio. Verifica che Hermes sia tornato attivo e riprova."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wtyczka nie odpowiedziała po ponownym uruchomieniu. Sprawdź, czy Hermes wstał, i spróbuj ponownie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O plugin não respondeu após o reinício. Verifique se o Hermes voltou e tente novamente."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De plug-in reageerde niet na de herstart. Controleer of Hermes weer draait en probeer het opnieuw."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Eklenti yeniden başlatmadan sonra yanıt vermedi. Hermes’in geri geldiğini doğrulayıp tekrar deneyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Плагин не ответил после перезапуска. Убедитесь, что Hermes снова работает, и повторите попытку."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再起動後にプラグインが応答しませんでした。Hermes が復帰したか確認して、もう一度お試しください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重启后插件没有响应。请确认 Hermes 已恢复运行，然后重试。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재시작 후 플러그인이 응답하지 않았습니다. Hermes가 다시 실행됐는지 확인한 뒤 다시 시도하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لم تستجب الإضافة بعد إعادة التشغيل. تأكد من عودة Hermes للعمل ثم حاول مرة أخرى."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"התוסף לא הגיב לאחר ההפעלה מחדש. יש לוודא ש‑Hermes חזר לפעול ולנסות שוב."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"دوبارہ شروع ہونے کے بعد پلگ ان نے جواب نہیں دیا۔ تصدیق کریں کہ Hermes واپس چل پڑا ہے، پھر دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新啟動後外掛程式沒有回應。請確認 Hermes 已恢復運作，然後再試一次。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新啟動後外掛程式沒有回應。請確認 Hermes 已恢復運作，然後再試一次。"}}}},
    "The relay refused this phone (%lld). Check the relay address, then try again." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Das Relay hat dieses Telefon abgelehnt (%lld). Prüfe die Relay-Adresse und versuche es erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El relé rechazó este teléfono (%lld). Comprueba la dirección del relé e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le relais a refusé ce téléphone (%lld). Vérifiez l’adresse du relais, puis réessayez."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il relay ha rifiutato questo telefono (%lld). Controlla l’indirizzo del relay e riprova."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przekaźnik odrzucił ten telefon (%lld). Sprawdź adres przekaźnika i spróbuj ponownie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O relay recusou este telefone (%lld). Verifique o endereço do relay e tente novamente."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De relay weigerde deze telefoon (%lld). Controleer het relay-adres en probeer het opnieuw."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktarıcı bu telefonu reddetti (%lld). Aktarıcı adresini kontrol edip tekrar deneyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Релей отклонил этот телефон (%lld). Проверьте адрес релея и повторите попытку."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"リレーがこの iPhone を拒否しました（%lld）。リレーのアドレスを確認して、もう一度お試しください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中继拒绝了此设备（%lld）。请检查中继地址后重试。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"릴레이가 이 기기를 거부했습니다(%lld). 릴레이 주소를 확인한 뒤 다시 시도하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"رفض المُرحِّل هذا الهاتف (%lld). تحقق من عنوان المُرحِّل ثم حاول مرة أخرى."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"הממסר דחה את המכשיר הזה (%lld). יש לבדוק את כתובת הממסר ולנסות שוב."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ریلے نے اس فون کو مسترد کر دیا (%lld)۔ ریلے کا پتہ جانچیں، پھر دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中繼拒絕了此裝置（%lld）。請檢查中繼位址後再試一次。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中繼拒絕了此裝置（%lld）。請檢查中繼位址後再試一次。"}}}},
    "Connect to this Hermes host first." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verbinde dich zuerst mit diesem Hermes-Host."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Conéctate primero a este host de Hermes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connectez-vous d’abord à cet hôte Hermes."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Collegati prima a questo host Hermes."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Najpierw połącz się z tym hostem Hermes."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Conecte-se primeiro a este host do Hermes."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Maak eerst verbinding met deze Hermes-host."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Önce bu Hermes sunucusuna bağlanın."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сначала подключитесь к этому хосту Hermes."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"先にこの Hermes ホストに接続してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请先连接到此 Hermes 主机。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"먼저 이 Hermes 호스트에 연결하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اتصل أولاً بمضيف Hermes هذا."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"יש להתחבר תחילה למארח Hermes הזה."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"پہلے اس Hermes ہوسٹ سے جڑیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請先連線到此 Hermes 主機。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請先連線到此 Hermes 主機。"}}}},
    "Could not reach this Hermes host. Check the connection, then try again." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieser Hermes-Host war nicht erreichbar. Prüfe die Verbindung und versuche es erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo contactar con este host de Hermes. Comprueba la conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossible de joindre cet hôte Hermes. Vérifiez la connexion, puis réessayez."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile raggiungere questo host Hermes. Controlla la connessione e riprova."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie udało się połączyć z tym hostem Hermes. Sprawdź połączenie i spróbuj ponownie."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível acessar este host do Hermes. Verifique a conexão e tente novamente."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze Hermes-host was niet bereikbaar. Controleer de verbinding en probeer het opnieuw."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu Hermes sunucusuna ulaşılamadı. Bağlantıyı kontrol edip tekrar deneyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось связаться с этим хостом Hermes. Проверьте подключение и повторите попытку."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この Hermes ホストに接続できませんでした。接続を確認して、もう一度お試しください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法连接此 Hermes 主机。请检查连接后重试。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 Hermes 호스트에 연결할 수 없습니다. 연결을 확인한 뒤 다시 시도하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تعذّر الوصول إلى مضيف Hermes هذا. تحقق من الاتصال ثم حاول مرة أخرى."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"לא ניתן היה להגיע למארח Hermes הזה. יש לבדוק את החיבור ולנסות שוב."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اس Hermes ہوسٹ تک رسائی نہیں ہو سکی۔ کنکشن جانچیں، پھر دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法連線至此 Hermes 主機。請檢查連線後再試一次。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法連線至此 Hermes 主機。請檢查連線後再試一次。"}}}},
    "This iPhone is paired with this server’s Hermes host. Its keys are stored in the Keychain for this server alone." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieses iPhone ist mit dem Hermes-Host dieses Servers gekoppelt. Seine Schlüssel liegen im Schlüsselbund und gelten nur für diesen Server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este iPhone está emparejado con el host de Hermes de este servidor. Sus claves se guardan en el Llavero solo para este servidor."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cet iPhone est jumelé à l’hôte Hermes de ce serveur. Ses clés sont stockées dans le Trousseau pour ce serveur uniquement."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo iPhone è associato all’host Hermes di questo server. Le sue chiavi sono nel Portachiavi solo per questo server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten iPhone jest sparowany z hostem Hermes tego serwera. Jego klucze są w Pęku kluczy wyłącznie dla tego serwera."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este iPhone está pareado com o host do Hermes deste servidor. Suas chaves ficam no Chaveiro apenas para este servidor."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze iPhone is gekoppeld aan de Hermes-host van deze server. De sleutels staan in de Sleutelhanger, alleen voor deze server."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu iPhone, bu sunucunun Hermes ana makinesiyle eşleştirildi. Anahtarları yalnızca bu sunucu için Anahtar Zinciri’nde saklanır."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот iPhone связан с хостом Hermes этого сервера. Его ключи хранятся в связке ключей только для этого сервера."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この iPhone はこのサーバの Hermes ホストとペアリングされています。キーはこのサーバ専用としてキーチェーンに保管されます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 已与该服务器的 Hermes 主机配对。其密钥仅为该服务器保存在钥匙串中。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 iPhone은 이 서버의 Hermes 호스트와 페어링되어 있습니다. 키는 이 서버 전용으로 키체인에 저장됩니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"هذا الـ iPhone مقترن بمضيف Hermes الخاص بهذا الخادم. تُحفظ مفاتيحه في سلسلة المفاتيح لهذا الخادم وحده."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"‏iPhone זה מותאם למארח Hermes של שרת זה. המפתחות שלו נשמרים במחזיק המפתחות עבור שרת זה בלבד."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ iPhone اس سرور کے Hermes ہوسٹ کے ساتھ پیئر ہے۔ اس کی کیز صرف اسی سرور کے لیے کی چین میں محفوظ ہیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 已與該伺服器的 Hermes 主機配對。其密鑰僅為該伺服器儲存在鑰匙圈中。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 已與該伺服器的 Hermes 主機配對。其密鑰僅為該伺服器儲存在鑰匙圈中。"}}}},
    "This iPhone is removed from the relay, the plugin is disabled on your Hermes host, and the keys stored on this iPhone are deleted." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieses iPhone wird vom Relay entfernt, das Plug-in auf deinem Hermes-Host wird deaktiviert und die auf diesem iPhone gespeicherten Schlüssel werden gelöscht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este iPhone se quita del relé, el complemento se desactiva en tu host de Hermes y se eliminan las claves guardadas en este iPhone."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cet iPhone est retiré du relais, le plug-in est désactivé sur votre hôte Hermes et les clés stockées sur cet iPhone sont supprimées."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo iPhone viene rimosso dal relay, il plugin viene disattivato sul tuo host Hermes e le chiavi salvate su questo iPhone vengono eliminate."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten iPhone zostanie usunięty z przekaźnika, wtyczka na twoim hoście Hermes zostanie wyłączona, a klucze zapisane na tym iPhonie zostaną usunięte."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este iPhone é removido do relay, o plugin é desativado no seu host do Hermes e as chaves guardadas neste iPhone são apagadas."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze iPhone wordt van de relay verwijderd, de plug-in wordt op je Hermes-host uitgeschakeld en de sleutels op deze iPhone worden verwijderd."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu iPhone aktarıcıdan kaldırılır, eklenti Hermes sunucunuzda devre dışı bırakılır ve bu iPhone’da saklanan anahtarlar silinir."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот iPhone будет удалён из релея, плагин на вашем хосте Hermes будет отключён, а ключи на этом iPhone удалены."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この iPhone はリレーから削除され、Hermes ホスト上のプラグインは無効になり、この iPhone に保存されたキーは削除されます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 会从中继移除，你的 Hermes 主机上的插件会被停用，此 iPhone 上保存的密钥会被删除。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 iPhone이 릴레이에서 제거되고, Hermes 호스트의 플러그인이 비활성화되며, 이 iPhone에 저장된 키가 삭제됩니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ستتم إزالة هذا الـ iPhone من المُرحِّل، وتعطيل الإضافة على مضيف Hermes الخاص بك، وحذف المفاتيح المحفوظة على هذا الـ iPhone."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"‏iPhone זה יוסר מהממסר, התוסף יושבת במארח Hermes שלך, והמפתחות השמורים ב‑iPhone הזה יימחקו."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ iPhone ریلے سے ہٹا دیا جائے گا، آپ کے Hermes ہوسٹ پر پلگ ان غیر فعال ہو جائے گا، اور اس iPhone پر محفوظ کیز حذف ہو جائیں گی۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 會從中繼移除，你的 Hermes 主機上的外掛程式會被停用，此 iPhone 上儲存的密鑰會被刪除。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 iPhone 會從中繼移除，你的 Hermes 主機上的外掛程式會被停用，此 iPhone 上儲存的密鑰會被刪除。"}}}},
    "Sign in to this server’s Hermes backend to turn on notifications for it, and to use Bots." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Melde dich beim Hermes-Backend dieses Servers an, um Mitteilungen dafür zu aktivieren und Bots zu nutzen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inicia sesión en el backend de Hermes de este servidor para activar sus notificaciones y usar los Bots."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Connectez-vous au backend Hermes de ce serveur pour activer ses notifications et utiliser les Bots."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Accedi al backend Hermes di questo server per attivarne le notifiche e usare i Bot."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zaloguj się do backendu Hermes tego serwera, aby włączyć dla niego powiadomienia i korzystać z Botów."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entre no backend do Hermes deste servidor para ativar as notificações dele e usar os Bots."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Log in op de Hermes-backend van deze server om er meldingen voor in te schakelen en Bots te gebruiken."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu sunucunun bildirimlerini açmak ve Bot’ları kullanmak için Hermes arka ucunda oturum açın."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Войдите в бэкенд Hermes этого сервера, чтобы включить для него уведомления и пользоваться ботами."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このサーバの通知をオンにし、Bots を使うには、そのサーバの Hermes バックエンドにサインインしてください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"登录此服务器的 Hermes 后端，即可为其开启通知并使用 Bots。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 서버의 알림을 켜고 Bots를 사용하려면 해당 서버의 Hermes 백엔드에 로그인하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"سجّل الدخول إلى خلفية Hermes لهذا الخادم لتشغيل إشعاراته واستخدام Bots."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"יש להתחבר לשרת ה‑Hermes של שרת זה כדי להפעיל עבורו התראות ולהשתמש ב‑Bots."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اس سرور کے لیے اطلاعات آن کرنے اور Bots استعمال کرنے کے لیے اس کے Hermes بیک اینڈ میں سائن اِن کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"登入此伺服器的 Hermes 後端，即可為其開啟通知並使用 Bots。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"登入此伺服器的 Hermes 後端，即可為其開啟通知並使用 Bots。"}}}},
    "This connection belongs to the selected Hermex server. Use the address and password of your existing Hermes backend on LAN, a tailnet or a tunnel. Sessions work without it — add it to turn on notifications for this server, and to use Bots." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diese Verbindung gehört zum ausgewählten Hermex-Server. Verwende Adresse und Passwort deines vorhandenen Hermes-Backends im LAN, im Tailnet oder über einen Tunnel. Sessions funktionieren auch ohne sie — füge sie hinzu, um Mitteilungen für diesen Server zu aktivieren und Bots zu nutzen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esta conexión pertenece al servidor de Hermex seleccionado. Usa la dirección y la contraseña de tu backend de Hermes en la LAN, en una tailnet o a través de un túnel. Las sesiones funcionan sin ella: añádela para activar las notificaciones de este servidor y usar los Bots."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cette connexion appartient au serveur Hermex sélectionné. Utilisez l’adresse et le mot de passe de votre backend Hermes existant, sur le LAN, un tailnet ou un tunnel. Les sessions fonctionnent sans elle — ajoutez-la pour activer les notifications de ce serveur et utiliser les Bots."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questa connessione appartiene al server Hermex selezionato. Usa indirizzo e password del tuo backend Hermes esistente su LAN, tailnet o tunnel. Le sessioni funzionano anche senza — aggiungila per attivare le notifiche di questo server e usare i Bot."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"To połączenie należy do wybranego serwera Hermex. Użyj adresu i hasła swojego backendu Hermes w sieci LAN, w tailnecie lub przez tunel. Sesje działają bez niego — dodaj je, aby włączyć powiadomienia dla tego serwera i korzystać z Botów."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esta conexão pertence ao servidor do Hermex selecionado. Use o endereço e a senha do seu backend do Hermes na LAN, em uma tailnet ou por um túnel. As sessões funcionam sem ela — adicione-a para ativar as notificações deste servidor e usar os Bots."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze verbinding hoort bij de geselecteerde Hermex-server. Gebruik het adres en wachtwoord van je bestaande Hermes-backend op het LAN, een tailnet of een tunnel. Sessies werken ook zonder — voeg de verbinding toe om meldingen voor deze server in te schakelen en Bots te gebruiken."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu bağlantı, seçili Hermex sunucusuna aittir. Mevcut Hermes arka ucunuzun LAN, tailnet veya tünel üzerindeki adresini ve parolasını kullanın. Oturumlar bu bağlantı olmadan da çalışır — bu sunucunun bildirimlerini açmak ve Bot’ları kullanmak için ekleyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Это подключение принадлежит выбранному серверу Hermex. Укажите адрес и пароль вашего бэкенда Hermes в локальной сети, в tailnet или через туннель. Сессии работают и без него — добавьте его, чтобы включить уведомления для этого сервера и пользоваться ботами."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この接続は選択中の Hermex サーバに属します。LAN、tailnet、またはトンネル経由で、既存の Hermes バックエンドのアドレスとパスワードを入力してください。セッションは接続なしでも使えます。追加すると、このサーバの通知をオンにでき、Bots も使えます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此连接属于所选的 Hermex 服务器。请填写你现有 Hermes 后端在局域网、tailnet 或隧道上的地址与密码。没有它会话也能使用——添加后可为此服务器开启通知，并使用 Bots。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 연결은 선택한 Hermex 서버에 속합니다. LAN, tailnet 또는 터널에 있는 기존 Hermes 백엔드의 주소와 비밀번호를 입력하세요. 연결 없이도 세션은 작동합니다. 추가하면 이 서버의 알림을 켜고 Bots를 사용할 수 있습니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ينتمي هذا الاتصال إلى خادم Hermex المحدد. استخدم عنوان وكلمة سر خلفية Hermes الحالية على الشبكة المحلية أو tailnet أو عبر نفق. تعمل الجلسات بدونه — أضفه لتشغيل إشعارات هذا الخادم واستخدام Bots."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"חיבור זה שייך לשרת Hermex שנבחר. יש להשתמש בכתובת ובסיסמה של שרת ה‑Hermes הקיים שלך ברשת המקומית, ב‑tailnet או דרך מנהרה. הסשנים פועלים גם בלעדיו — יש להוסיף אותו כדי להפעיל התראות עבור שרת זה ולהשתמש ב‑Bots."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ کنکشن منتخب Hermex سرور سے تعلق رکھتا ہے۔ اپنے موجودہ Hermes بیک اینڈ کا پتہ اور پاس ورڈ استعمال کریں، چاہے LAN، tailnet یا ٹنل پر ہو۔ سیشنز اس کے بغیر بھی چلتے ہیں — اسے شامل کریں تاکہ اس سرور کے لیے اطلاعات آن ہوں اور Bots استعمال ہو سکیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此連線屬於所選的 Hermex 伺服器。請填寫你現有 Hermes 後端在區域網路、tailnet 或通道上的位址與密碼。沒有它工作階段也能使用——加入後可為此伺服器開啟通知，並使用 Bots。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此連線屬於所選的 Hermex 伺服器。請填寫你現有 Hermes 後端在區域網路、tailnet 或通道上的位址與密碼。沒有它工作階段也能使用——加入後可為此伺服器開啟通知，並使用 Bots。"}}}},
    "Saved sign-in details, this connection’s drafts and its notification keys will be deleted. This iPhone stops receiving this host’s notifications. Bots and their work remain on the host." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gespeicherte Anmeldedaten, die Entwürfe dieser Verbindung und ihre Mitteilungsschlüssel werden gelöscht. Dieses iPhone erhält keine Mitteilungen dieses Hosts mehr. Bots und ihre Arbeit bleiben auf dem Host."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se eliminarán los datos de inicio de sesión guardados, los borradores de esta conexión y sus claves de notificación. Este iPhone dejará de recibir las notificaciones de este host. Los Bots y su trabajo permanecen en el host."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les identifiants enregistrés, les brouillons de cette connexion et ses clés de notification seront supprimés. Cet iPhone cessera de recevoir les notifications de cet hôte. Les Bots et leur travail restent sur l’hôte."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I dati di accesso salvati, le bozze di questa connessione e le sue chiavi di notifica verranno eliminati. Questo iPhone smetterà di ricevere le notifiche di questo host. I Bot e il loro lavoro restano sull’host."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zapisane dane logowania, wersje robocze tego połączenia i jego klucze powiadomień zostaną usunięte. Ten iPhone przestanie odbierać powiadomienia z tego hosta. Boty i ich praca pozostają na hoście."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Os dados de acesso salvos, os rascunhos desta conexão e suas chaves de notificação serão apagados. Este iPhone deixará de receber as notificações deste host. Os Bots e o trabalho deles permanecem no host."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bewaarde inloggegevens, de concepten van deze verbinding en de meldingssleutels worden verwijderd. Deze iPhone ontvangt geen meldingen meer van deze host. Bots en hun werk blijven op de host."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kayıtlı oturum bilgileri, bu bağlantının taslakları ve bildirim anahtarları silinecek. Bu iPhone artık bu sunucunun bildirimlerini almayacak. Bot’lar ve işleri sunucuda kalır."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сохранённые данные для входа, черновики этого подключения и его ключи уведомлений будут удалены. Этот iPhone перестанет получать уведомления с этого хоста. Боты и их работа остаются на хосте."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存されたサインイン情報、この接続の下書き、通知キーが削除されます。この iPhone はこのホストの通知を受け取らなくなります。Bots とその作業はホストに残ります。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已保存的登录信息、此连接的草稿及其通知密钥将被删除。此 iPhone 将不再接收该主机的通知。Bots 及其工作仍保留在主机上。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장된 로그인 정보, 이 연결의 초안, 알림 키가 삭제됩니다. 이 iPhone은 이 호스트의 알림을 더 이상 받지 않습니다. Bots와 그 작업은 호스트에 남습니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ستُحذف بيانات تسجيل الدخول المحفوظة ومسودات هذا الاتصال ومفاتيح الإشعارات الخاصة به. سيتوقف هذا الـ iPhone عن تلقي إشعارات هذا المضيف. تبقى Bots وأعمالها على المضيف."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"פרטי הכניסה השמורים, הטיוטות של חיבור זה ומפתחות ההתראות שלו יימחקו. ה‑iPhone הזה יפסיק לקבל התראות מהמארח הזה. ה‑Bots והעבודה שלהם נשארים במארח."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"محفوظ سائن اِن تفصیلات، اس کنکشن کے ڈرافٹس اور اس کی اطلاعاتی کیز حذف ہو جائیں گی۔ یہ iPhone اس ہوسٹ کی اطلاعات وصول کرنا بند کر دے گا۔ Bots اور ان کا کام ہوسٹ پر برقرار رہتا ہے۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已儲存的登入資訊、此連線的草稿及其通知密鑰將被刪除。此 iPhone 將不再接收該主機的通知。Bots 及其工作仍保留在主機上。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已儲存的登入資訊、此連線的草稿及其通知密鑰將被刪除。此 iPhone 將不再接收該主機的通知。Bots 及其工作仍保留在主機上。"}}}},
    "Delegated worker" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegierter Worker"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker delegado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker délégué"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker delegato"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegowany proces roboczy"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker delegado"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedelegeerde worker"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Devredilen worker"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Делегированный воркер"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委任されたワーカー"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已委派的工作进程"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"위임된 워커"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"عملية عاملة مفوّضة"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"תהליך עבודה מואצל"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تفویض شدہ ورکر"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已委派的工作程序"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"已委派的工作程序"}}}},
    "This Hermes connection no longer owns these workers. Reconnect to inspect them." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diese Hermes-Verbindung besitzt diese Worker nicht mehr. Stelle die Verbindung erneut her, um sie zu prüfen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esta conexión de Hermes ya no controla estos workers. Vuelve a conectarte para inspeccionarlos."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cette connexion Hermes ne contrôle plus ces workers. Reconnectez-vous pour les inspecter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questa connessione Hermes non controlla più questi worker. Riconnettiti per ispezionarli."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"To połączenie Hermes nie kontroluje już tych procesów roboczych. Połącz się ponownie, aby je sprawdzić."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esta conexão do Hermes não controla mais estes workers. Reconecte para inspecioná-los."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze Hermes-verbinding beheert deze workers niet meer. Maak opnieuw verbinding om ze te bekijken."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu Hermes bağlantısı artık bu worker'ları yönetmiyor. İncelemek için yeniden bağlanın."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Это подключение Hermes больше не управляет этими воркерами. Переподключитесь, чтобы проверить их."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この Hermes 接続はこれらのワーカーを管理していません。確認するには再接続してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 连接已不再拥有这些工作进程。请重新连接以检查它们。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 Hermes 연결은 더 이상 이 워커를 관리하지 않습니다. 확인하려면 다시 연결하세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لم يعد اتصال Hermes هذا يملك هذه العمليات العاملة. أعد الاتصال لفحصها."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"חיבור Hermes זה כבר אינו שולט בתהליכי העבודה האלה. יש להתחבר מחדש כדי לבדוק אותם."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ Hermes کنکشن اب ان ورکرز کا مالک نہیں ہے۔ ان کا جائزہ لینے کے لیے دوبارہ جڑیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 連線已不再擁有這些工作程序。請重新連線以檢查它們。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 連線已不再擁有這些工作程序。請重新連線以檢查它們。"}}}},
    "This Hermes host does not support delegated-work inspection." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieser Hermes-Host unterstützt die Prüfung delegierter Arbeit nicht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este host de Hermes no admite la inspección del trabajo delegado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cet hôte Hermes ne prend pas en charge l’inspection du travail délégué."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo host Hermes non supporta l’ispezione del lavoro delegato."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten host Hermes nie obsługuje inspekcji delegowanej pracy."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este host do Hermes não oferece inspeção de trabalho delegado."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze Hermes-host ondersteunt geen inspectie van gedelegeerd werk."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu Hermes ana bilgisayarı devredilen iş incelemesini desteklemiyor."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот хост Hermes не поддерживает просмотр делегированной работы."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この Hermes ホストは委任された作業の確認に対応していません。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主机不支持检查委派工作。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 Hermes 호스트는 위임된 작업 검사를 지원하지 않습니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مضيف Hermes هذا لا يدعم فحص العمل المفوّض."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"מארח Hermes זה אינו תומך בבדיקת עבודה מואצלת."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ Hermes ہوسٹ تفویض شدہ کام کے جائزے کو سپورٹ نہیں کرتا۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主機不支援檢查委派工作。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此 Hermes 主機不支援檢查委派工作。"}}}},
    "The result is unknown. Reconnect and refresh before acting again." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Das Ergebnis ist unbekannt. Stelle die Verbindung erneut her und aktualisiere, bevor du wieder handelst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se desconoce el resultado. Vuelve a conectarte y actualiza antes de actuar de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le résultat est inconnu. Reconnectez-vous et actualisez avant d’agir à nouveau."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il risultato è sconosciuto. Riconnettiti e aggiorna prima di agire di nuovo."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wynik jest nieznany. Połącz się ponownie i odśwież przed kolejnym działaniem."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O resultado é desconhecido. Reconecte e atualize antes de agir novamente."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Het resultaat is onbekend. Maak opnieuw verbinding en vernieuw voordat je weer handelt."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sonuç bilinmiyor. Yeniden işlem yapmadan önce bağlanıp yenileyin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Результат неизвестен. Переподключитесь и обновите данные, прежде чем действовать снова."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"結果は不明です。再操作する前に再接続して更新してください。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"结果未知。再次操作前，请重新连接并刷新。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결과를 알 수 없습니다. 다시 작업하기 전에 재연결하고 새로 고치세요."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"النتيجة غير معروفة. أعد الاتصال وحدّث قبل اتخاذ إجراء آخر."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"התוצאה אינה ידועה. יש להתחבר מחדש ולרענן לפני פעולה נוספת."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"نتیجہ معلوم نہیں۔ دوبارہ کارروائی سے پہلے دوبارہ جڑیں اور ریفریش کریں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"結果未知。再次操作前，請重新連線並重新整理。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"結果未知。再次操作前，請重新連線並重新整理。"}}}},
    "This worker is no longer active." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dieser Worker ist nicht mehr aktiv."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este worker ya no está activo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ce worker n’est plus actif."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo worker non è più attivo."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ten proces roboczy nie jest już aktywny."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Este worker não está mais ativo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze worker is niet meer actief."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu worker artık etkin değil."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот воркер больше не активен."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このワーカーは現在アクティブではありません。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此工作进程已不再活跃。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 워커는 더 이상 활성 상태가 아닙니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لم تعد هذه العملية العاملة نشطة."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"תהליך עבודה זה כבר אינו פעיל."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"یہ ورکر اب فعال نہیں ہے۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此工作程序已不再活躍。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此工作程序已不再活躍。"}}}},
    "Delegated work could not be refreshed." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegierte Arbeit konnte nicht aktualisiert werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo actualizar el trabajo delegado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossible d’actualiser le travail délégué."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile aggiornare il lavoro delegato."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie udało się odświeżyć delegowanej pracy."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível atualizar o trabalho delegado."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedelegeerd werk kon niet worden vernieuwd."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Devredilen iş yenilenemedi."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось обновить делегированную работу."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委任された作業を更新できませんでした。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法刷新委派工作。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"위임된 작업을 새로 고칠 수 없습니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تعذّر تحديث العمل المفوّض."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"לא ניתן לרענן את העבודה המואצלת."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تفویض شدہ کام ریفریش نہیں ہو سکا۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法重新整理委派工作。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法重新整理委派工作。"}}}},
    "Delegated work" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegierte Arbeit"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Trabajo delegado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Travail délégué"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lavoro delegato"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegowana praca"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Trabalho delegado"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedelegeerd werk"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Devredilen iş"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Делегированная работа"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委任された作業"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委派工作"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"위임된 작업"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"العمل المفوّض"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"עבודה מואצלת"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تفویض شدہ کام"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委派工作"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委派工作"}}}},
    "No active workers" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keine aktiven Worker"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No hay workers activos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aucun worker actif"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nessun worker attivo"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Brak aktywnych procesów roboczych"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nenhum worker ativo"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Geen actieve workers"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Etkin worker yok"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Нет активных воркеров"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アクティブなワーカーはありません"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"没有活跃的工作进程"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"활성 워커 없음"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لا توجد عمليات عاملة نشطة"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"אין תהליכי עבודה פעילים"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"کوئی فعال ورکر نہیں"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"沒有活躍的工作程序"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"沒有活躍的工作程序"}}}},
    "Refreshing delegated work…" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegierte Arbeit wird aktualisiert…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Actualizando el trabajo delegado…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Actualisation du travail délégué…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiornamento del lavoro delegato…"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odświeżanie delegowanej pracy…"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Atualizando o trabalho delegado…"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedelegeerd werk vernieuwen…"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Devredilen iş yenileniyor…"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Обновление делегированной работы…"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委任された作業を更新中…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在刷新委派工作…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"위임된 작업 새로 고치는 중…"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"جارٍ تحديث العمل المفوّض…"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"העבודה המואצלת מתרעננת…"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تفویض شدہ کام ریفریش ہو رہا ہے…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在重新整理委派工作…"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在重新整理委派工作…"}}}},
    "Workers appear here while this bot has delegated work in progress." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker werden hier angezeigt, während dieser Bot delegierte Arbeit ausführt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Los workers aparecen aquí mientras este bot tiene trabajo delegado en curso."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les workers apparaissent ici pendant que ce bot exécute du travail délégué."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"I worker appaiono qui mentre questo bot esegue lavoro delegato."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Procesy robocze pojawiają się tutaj, gdy ten bot wykonuje delegowaną pracę."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Os workers aparecem aqui enquanto este bot executa trabalho delegado."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Workers verschijnen hier terwijl deze bot gedelegeerd werk uitvoert."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu botun devam eden devredilmiş işi olduğunda worker'lar burada görünür."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Здесь отображаются воркеры, пока этот бот выполняет делегированную работу."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このボットが委任された作業を実行している間、ワーカーがここに表示されます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此机器人有委派工作正在进行时，工作进程会显示在这里。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 봇이 위임된 작업을 수행하는 동안 워커가 여기에 표시됩니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تظهر العمليات العاملة هنا بينما ينفّذ هذا البوت عملاً مفوّضًا."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"תהליכי עבודה מופיעים כאן בזמן שהבוט מבצע עבודה מואצלת."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"جب یہ بوٹ تفویض شدہ کام کر رہا ہو تو ورکرز یہاں دکھائی دیتے ہیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此機器人有委派工作正在進行時，工作程序會顯示在這裡。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此機械人有委派工作正在進行時，工作程序會顯示在這裡。"}}}},
    "Active workers" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktive Worker"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Workers activos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Workers actifs"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker attivi"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktywne procesy robocze"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Workers ativos"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Actieve workers"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Etkin worker'lar"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Активные воркеры"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アクティブなワーカー"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"活跃的工作进程"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"활성 워커"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"العمليات العاملة النشطة"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"תהליכי עבודה פעילים"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"فعال ورکرز"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"活躍的工作程序"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"活躍的工作程序"}}}},
    "Showing the first %lld workers. %lld more are active." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die ersten %lld Worker werden angezeigt. %lld weitere sind aktiv."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Se muestran los primeros %lld workers. Hay %lld más activos."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Affichage des %lld premiers workers. %lld autres sont actifs."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sono mostrati i primi %lld worker. Altri %lld sono attivi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wyświetlono pierwsze %lld procesów. Aktywnych jest jeszcze %lld."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mostrando os primeiros %lld workers. Há mais %lld ativos."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De eerste %lld workers worden weergegeven. Er zijn nog %lld actief."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İlk %lld worker gösteriliyor. %lld worker daha etkin."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Показаны первые %lld воркеров. Ещё %lld активны."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"最初の %lld 件のワーカーを表示しています。ほかに %lld 件がアクティブです。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在显示前 %lld 个工作进程。另有 %lld 个正在运行。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"처음 %lld개 워커를 표시합니다. %lld개가 더 활성 상태입니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يتم عرض أول %lld عملية عاملة. وهناك %lld أخرى نشطة."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"מוצגים %lld תהליכי העבודה הראשונים. %lld נוספים פעילים."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"پہلے %lld ورکرز دکھائے جا رہے ہیں۔ مزید %lld فعال ہیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在顯示前 %lld 個工作程序。另有 %lld 個正在執行。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"正在顯示前 %lld 個工作程序。另有 %lld 個正在執行。"}}}},
    "Tails load only when requested and are limited to 16 KB." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ausgaben werden nur auf Anfrage geladen und sind auf 16 KB begrenzt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las salidas se cargan solo cuando se solicitan y están limitadas a 16 KB."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les sorties ne sont chargées qu’à la demande et sont limitées à 16 Ko."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gli output vengono caricati solo su richiesta e sono limitati a 16 KB."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dane wyjściowe są ładowane tylko na żądanie i ograniczone do 16 KB."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"As saídas são carregadas somente quando solicitadas e limitadas a 16 KB."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uitvoer wordt alleen op verzoek geladen en is beperkt tot 16 KB."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Çıktılar yalnızca istendiğinde yüklenir ve 16 KB ile sınırlıdır."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Вывод загружается только по запросу и ограничен 16 КБ."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"出力は要求時にのみ読み込まれ、16 KB に制限されます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"仅在请求时加载输出，最多显示 16 KB。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"출력은 요청할 때만 불러오며 16KB로 제한됩니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"لا يتم تحميل المخرجات إلا عند طلبها، وتقتصر على 16 كيلوبايت."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"הפלט נטען רק לפי בקשה ומוגבל ל‑16 KB."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"آؤٹ پٹ صرف درخواست پر لوڈ ہوتا ہے اور 16 KB تک محدود ہے۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"僅在要求時載入輸出，最多顯示 16 KB。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"只在要求時載入輸出，最多顯示 16 KB。"}}}},
    "Refresh delegated work" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Delegierte Arbeit aktualisieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Actualizar el trabajo delegado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Actualiser le travail délégué"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aggiorna il lavoro delegato"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odśwież delegowaną pracę"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Atualizar trabalho delegado"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gedelegeerd werk vernieuwen"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Devredilen işi yenile"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Обновить делегированную работу"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"委任された作業を更新"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"刷新委派工作"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"위임된 작업 새로 고침"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تحديث العمل المفوّض"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"רענון עבודה מואצלת"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تفویض شدہ کام ریفریش کریں"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新整理委派工作"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"重新整理委派工作"}}}},
    "Interrupt “%@”?" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"„%@“ unterbrechen?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Interrumpir «%@»?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompre « %@ » ?"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompere “%@”?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przerwać „%@” ?"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interromper “%@”?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"‘%@’ onderbreken?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” kesilsin mi?"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Прервать «%@»?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」を中断しますか？"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中断“%@”？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"‘%@’을(를) 중단할까요?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"هل تريد مقاطعة «%@»؟"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"להפסיק את „%@” ?"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"کیا ”%@“ کو روکیں؟"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷「%@」？"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷「%@」？"}}}},
    "Interrupt this worker?" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diesen Worker unterbrechen?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Interrumpir este worker?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompre ce worker ?"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompere questo worker?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przerwać ten proces roboczy?"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interromper este worker?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Deze worker onderbreken?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu worker kesilsin mi?"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Прервать этого воркера?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このワーカーを中断しますか？"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中断此工作进程？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 워커를 중단할까요?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"هل تريد مقاطعة هذه العملية العاملة؟"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"להפסיק תהליך עבודה זה?"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"کیا اس ورکر کو روکیں؟"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷此工作程序？"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷此工作程序？"}}}},
    "Interrupt worker" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker unterbrechen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrumpir worker"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompre le worker"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interrompi worker"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Przerwij proces roboczy"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Interromper worker"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker onderbreken"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Worker'ı kes"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Прервать воркера"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ワーカーを中断"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中断工作进程"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"워커 중단"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مقاطعة العملية العاملة"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"הפסקת תהליך עבודה"}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ورکر کو روکیں"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷工作程序"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"中斷工作程序"}}}},
    "This stops this delegated worker now. Hermex cannot resume it. The parent and sibling workers keep running." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dadurch wird dieser delegierte Worker jetzt gestoppt. Hermex kann ihn nicht fortsetzen. Übergeordnete und gleichgeordnete Worker laufen weiter."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Esto detiene ahora este worker delegado. Hermex no puede reanudarlo. El worker principal y los workers del mismo nivel seguirán ejecutándose."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cette action arrête immédiatement ce worker délégué. Hermex ne peut pas le reprendre. Le worker parent et les workers associés continuent de s’exécuter."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questa azione arresta subito il worker delegato. Hermex non può riprenderlo. Il worker principale e quelli paralleli continuano a funzionare."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spowoduje to natychmiastowe zatrzymanie delegowanego procesu roboczego. Hermex nie może go wznowić. Proces nadrzędny i procesy równoległe będą nadal działać."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Isso interrompe agora este worker delegado. O Hermex não pode retomá-lo. O worker principal e os workers paralelos continuam em execução."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Hiermee wordt deze gedelegeerde worker nu gestopt. Hermex kan hem niet hervatten. De bovenliggende en andere workers blijven actief."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu işlem devredilen worker'ı hemen durdurur. Hermex onu sürdüremez. Üst ve kardeş worker'lar çalışmaya devam eder."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Это немедленно остановит делегированного воркера. Hermex не сможет возобновить его. Родительский и соседние воркеры продолжат работу."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"この委任されたワーカーを今すぐ停止します。Hermex では再開できません。親ワーカーと同階層のワーカーは実行を続けます。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"这会立即停止此委派工作进程。Hermex 无法将其恢复。父工作进程和同级工作进程会继续运行。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 위임된 워커를 지금 중지합니다. Hermex에서는 재개할 수 없습니다. 상위 워커와 형제 워커는 계속 실행됩니다."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يؤدي هذا إلى إيقاف العملية العاملة المفوّضة الآن. لا يمكن لـ Hermex استئنافها. وتستمر العملية الأصلية والعمليات الشقيقة في العمل."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"פעולה זו עוצרת כעת את תהליך העבודה המואצל. Hermex אינו יכול להמשיך אותו. תהליך האב והתהליכים המקבילים ממשיכים לפעול."}},"ur":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اس سے یہ تفویض شدہ ورکر ابھی رک جاتا ہے۔ Hermex اسے دوبارہ شروع نہیں کر سکتا۔ بنیادی اور ساتھی ورکرز چلتے رہتے ہیں۔"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"這會立即停止此委派工作程序。Hermex 無法將其繼續。父工作程序和同層工作程序會繼續執行。"}},"zh-HK":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"這會立即停止此委派工作程序。Hermex 無法將其繼續。父工作程序和同層工作程序會繼續執行。"}}}},
